  Select Model and Effort
  /model add enables more models from your providers; /model probe re-detects

  1. Add custom model   Connect a new provider: enter its URL and API key,
                        then pick models
  2. gpt-5.5 (default)  Frontier model for complex coding, research, and real-
                        world work.
  3. gpt-5.4            Strong model for everyday coding.
  4. gpt-5.4-mini       Small, fast, and cost-efficient model for simpler
                        coding tasks.
  5. gpt-5.3-codex      Coding-optimized model.
› 6. gpt-5.2 (current)  Optimized for professional work and long-running
                        agents.

  Press enter to confirm or esc to go back
